00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-03-19T09:35:35Z"},"comments":8,"created_at":"2025-01-23T09:02:19Z","updated_at":"2025-01-24T15:11:30Z","closed_at":"2025-01-24T15:11:29Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: 4.4beta1\n- Not reproducible in: 4.4dev7\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.beta1 - Ubuntu 24.04.1 LTS 24.04 on Wayland - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - Mesa Intel(R) Xe Graphics (TGL GT2) - 11th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-1165G7 @ 2.80GHz (8 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nI have configured a NavigationAgent2D in a 2d top-down project with the path_postprocessing set to Edgecentered.\nAs you can see until 4.4dev7 the agent's behavior was very fluid:\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/783df2fd-6321-4153-8026-9d7b97736d7c\n\nSince 4.4beta1 this is not the case anymore:\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/252caccb-cc49-4bdc-bb95-7a9b7fd0806a\n\nThe issue seems related to the points that the agent calculates to create the path towards the target.\nI made a reproduction project where I print the points obtained from the get_next_path_position function of the NavigationAgent2D so you can see the difference in the terminal.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Create a new scene\n- Place a NavigationAgent2D\n- Set the NavigationAgent2D Path Postprocessing to Edgecentered\n- Create a script that makes the NavigationAgent2D follows a target getting the next path position (get_next_path_position function)\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nYou can try to open the same project with 4.4dev7 and then with 4.4beta1 to see the different behaviour. Nothing else is changed.\n\n[godot-navigation-agent-issue.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18517774/godot-navigation-agent-issue.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101955/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101955/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}